OL,3,GNEWSANo-confidence vote prompted by car
OL,4,Aparks row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has survived a
OL,7,Fno-confidence motion following a row
OL,8,Fover plans to build on car parks.
OL,10,FSarah Conboy's leadership of
OL,11,FHuntingdonshire District Council was
OL,12,Fput to a vote at an emergency meeting
OL,13,Fin Huntingdon on Tuesday evening.
OL,15,FDuring a fiery debate, councillors
OL,16,Fopposing the motion called it a "naked
OL,17,Fand naive attempt" to gain political
OL,18,Fpower, while those in favour said the
OL,19,Fadministration was "terrified of taking
OL,20,Fresponsibility".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
