OL,3,GNEWSANo-confidence vote prompted by car
OL,4,Aparks row
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat Conboy, who became
OL,7,Fleader in 2022 and was re-elected in
OL,8,FMay, said she was "deeply
OL,9,Funcomfortable" during the debate,
OL,10,Fadding: "It would be easier to resign,
OL,11,Fbut I haven't."
